Licensing coverage
==================

Original supporting material
----------------------------

Original project-owned supporting material in this repository is licensed
under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3 (LGPL-3). This covers
README.md, AGENTS.md, docs/, scripts/ (including probes and tests), config/,
.github/, root development/tooling configuration and Docker/Compose files,
and fixtures/oca-document-page/Dockerfile, subject to the exceptions below.
The complete terms are in addons/project_agile/LICENSE together with the
incorporated GNU GPL version 3 terms in addons/project_agile/COPYING.

This grant covers the project's own material, not third-party portions,
separately licensed contributions, or software referenced, downloaded or
installed by these files. Existing copyright notices and licence/version
permissions remain intact.

Addons and test fixtures
-----------------------

Licences are per addon. LGPL-3 is the established default for independently
authored Odoo addons; required AGPL licences and third-party notices are retained.

Each addon's __manifest__.py records its licence, and README.md lists the
modules, dependencies and licences. Each addon includes its applicable GNU
licence in LICENSE. LGPL addons also include the incorporated GNU GPL terms
in COPYING. These full texts do not replace individual copyright notices or
change an existing licence/version declaration.

The MIT notice for the GitHub test fixtures remains at
addons/project_agile_git_github/tests/fixtures/LICENSE. Retain that notice
when redistributing the covered fixtures.

